        "original_id": "7d73ca73-d81c-5bbb-b744-954e25f58a81",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Sutera, Province of Caltanissetta, Sicily, Palermo, Caltanissetta\n- People: Giuseppe Sorge\n- Plants: Rhodotypos scandens\n- Taxonomy: Rhodotypos, Rosaceae, Kerria\n\nFacts:\n- Sutera is a comune (municipality) in the Province of Caltanissetta in the Italian region of Sicily.\n- Sutera is located about 70 km southeast of Palermo and about 30 km west of Caltanissetta.\n- Giuseppe Sorge was born in Sutera, Sicily.\n- Rhodotypos scandens is the only species in the genus Rhodotypos.\n- Rhodotypos scandens is a deciduous shrub in the family Rosaceae.\n- Rhodotypos scandens is closely related to Kerria, and some botanists include it in the genus Kerria.",
